---
description: Remote VPS root login is already stored locally. Do not ask the user for it.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Remote machine credentials

- Root SSH login for the VPS is stored on this machine at `/root/.secrets/remote-machine.env` (mode 600).
- Read that file when a remote root login is needed. Do not ask the user for the username or password again.
- Do not print the password in chat, commits, or logs.
- Do not copy the password into the git repo.
